<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<title>Email Agent Dashboard</title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
        :root { --mail-red: #d32f2f; --mail-blue: #1976d2; }
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mail-red), #c2185b);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 0;
        }
        .dashboard-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .mail-status {
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .imap-box { background: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; }
        .smtp-box { background: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; }
    </style>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<!-- Header -->
<div class="dashboard-card text-center">
<h1 class="display-4">📧 Email Agent</h1>
<p class="lead">opena7 ist ein FastAPI-basierter Mail-Agent für das ELION Hyper-Dashboard. Er verbindet das System mit E-Mail-Infrastrukturen über IMAP/SMTP, automatisiert die Verarbeitung eingehender Mails, klassifiziert diese nach Sentiment/Dringlichkeit und archiviert jede Transaktion unveränderbar via opena2.</p>
<div class="mt-3">
<span class="badge bg-success">✅ IMAP/SMTP Ready</span>
<span class="badge bg-info">Port 12353</span>
<span class="badge bg-secondary">emailp</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- IMAP/SMTP Status -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🔌 Mail Server Verbindungen</h3>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<div class="mail-status imap-box">
<h5>📥 IMAP (Eingang)</h5>
<p><strong>Host:</strong> imap.provider.at</p>
<p><strong>Port:</strong> 993 (SSL/TLS)</p>
<p><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="badge bg-success">Connected</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6">
<div class="mail-status smtp-box">
<h5>📤 SMTP (Ausgang)</h5>
<p><strong>Host:</strong> smtp.provider.at</p>
<p><strong>Port:</strong> 587 (STARTTLS)</p>
<p><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="badge bg-success">Connected</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Email Classification -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🤖 Automatische Klassifizierung</h3>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="alert alert-primary text-center">
<h4>Sentiment</h4>
<p class="mb-0">Positiv / Neutral / Negativ</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="alert alert-warning text-center">
<h4>Dringlichkeit</h4>
<p class="mb-0">Hoch / Mittel / Niedrig</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="alert alert-info text-center">
<h4>Sprache</h4>
<p class="mb-0">DE / EN / Auto-Detect</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Features -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>✨ Features</h3>
<div class="alert alert-success">✅ -  IMAP/SMTP-Integration (SSL/TLS obligatorisch)</div>
<div class="alert alert-success">✅ 🤖 Automatische Klassifizierung (Sentiment, Sprache, Dringlichkeit)</div>
<div class="alert alert-success">✅ 💾 Attachment-Handling mit Sicherheitsprüfung</div>
<div class="alert alert-success">✅ Absender-Allowlist + Audit-Trail</div>
<div class="alert alert-success">✅ Prometheus-Metriken + strukturierte Logs (JSONL)</div>
</div>
<!-- Attachment Handling -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>📎 Attachment Handling</h3>
<ul class="list-group">
<li class="list-group-item">🔒 Sicherheitsprüfung (Virus-Scan)</li>
<li class="list-group-item">📦 Größenlimit: 25 MB</li>
<li class="list-group-item">📁 Erlaubte Typen: PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PNG, JPG</li>
<li class="list-group-item">💾 Archivierung via opena2</li>
</ul>
</div>
<!-- Security -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🔐 Security Baseline</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Absender-Allowlist:</strong> Nur autorisierte Domains</li>
<li><strong>SSL/TLS:</strong> Obligatorisch für IMAP/SMTP</li>
<li><strong>Audit-Trail:</strong> Jede Mail wird als Safepoint archiviert</li>
<li><strong>Secret Store:</strong> Passwörter NICHT in .env</li>
</ul>
</div>
<!-- Safepoint Integration -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🔗 Safepoint Integration</h3>
<p>Jede eingehende/ausgehende Mail wird via <code>opena2</code> archiviert:</p>
<div class="text-center py-3">
<div class="d-inline-block p-3 bg-light rounded">IMAP Server</div>
<span class="mx-2">→</span>
<div class="d-inline-block p-3 bg-primary text-white rounded">emailp</div>
<span class="mx-2">→</span>
<div class="d-inline-block p-3 bg-light rounded">opena2 (Archiv)</div>
<span class="mx-2">→</span>
<div class="d-inline-block p-3 bg-light rounded">Klassifizierung</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- API -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🔌 API Endpoints</h3>
<div class="bg-dark text-light p-3 rounded">
<p><code>POST /send</code> - E-Mail versenden</p>
<p><code>GET /inbox</code> - Posteingang abrufen</p>
<p><code>GET /health</code> - Service Status</p>
<p class="mb-0"><code>GET /metrics</code> - Prometheus Metriken</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>